# Welcome to GX

GX is a domain-specialised language to write array-based programs, including machine learning algorithms, data processing, or scientific programming. GX is designed to be embedded in a host language such as C++, Go or Python. For this website, GX is embedded in JavaScript using WebAssembly.

Click on the Run button (or press Shift+Enter) to execute the function named `Main`.

This overview is split into chapters, each composed of lessons. Access the next lesson by clicking on the arrow below or by using the keyboard arrows.

